# Public GA4 web measurement ID. Set in the Dokploy WEBSITE application's env.
# The Node website server reads it at startup; save and redeploy after changes.
# Static hosts/Vite preview must instead receive it before the Vite build.
# An explicitly blank runtime value disables Analytics, even if set at build time.
# Use a Web data stream in the same GA4 property linked to Firebase.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
